                                                "sense_id": "c5017b86-b562-3773-85f4-6584f3bbd753",
                                                "text": "An FBS (fasting blood sugar) measurement is the most convenient test after overnight fasting. […] You have diabetes if your FBS is 126 mg/dl or more. But confirm it once more the next day or any other day. If the next time also FBS is more than 126 mg/dl then definitely you have diabetes."
                                            }
